{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":51,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主对锡安的安慰"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“追求公义、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寻求耶和华的人啊，听我说。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要追想那磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们是从那里被凿出来的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要追想那岩穴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们是从那里被挖出来的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要追想你们的祖先亚伯拉罕和生你们的撒拉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼召亚伯拉罕的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他孤身一人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我赐福给他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他人丁兴旺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必安慰锡安和锡安所有的荒场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使旷野像伊甸园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使沙漠变成耶和华的园囿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"里面有欢喜、快乐、感谢和歌颂的声音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"“我的子民啊，要留心听我的话；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的国民啊，要侧耳听我说。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我必赐下训诲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公正必成为万民的光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公义临近，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的拯救已经开始，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的臂膀要审判万民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众海岛都在等候我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仰赖我的臂膀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们举目仰望诸天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"俯首观看大地吧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诸天必像烟云消散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地必像衣服一样渐渐破旧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的居民必像蚊蝇一样死亡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的救恩永远长存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公义永不废除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"认识公义、铭记我训诲的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听我说。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不要害怕人的辱骂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要畏惧他们的毁谤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为蛀虫必吃掉他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像吃衣服；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虫子必蚕食他们，如食羊毛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的公义永远长存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩延及万代。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，伸出臂膀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"施展能力吧，施展能力吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像从前的日子、远古的时代。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道不是你砍碎了拉哈伯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刺死了海怪吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道不是你使海洋和深渊干涸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在深海中开出道路让蒙救赎的人穿过的吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华救赎的子民必归回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必欢唱着回到锡安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永远的福乐必临到他们头上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必欢喜快乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再没有忧愁和叹息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“安慰你们的是我，是我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为什么要害怕难逃一死、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生命如草芥的世人呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你忘记了创造你、铺展诸天、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"奠立大地根基的耶和华吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的欺压者大发怒气，决意毁坏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就整天惊恐不安吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的怒气在哪里呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被囚的人快得释放了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不会死在牢中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不会缺乏食物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是你的上帝耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我翻动大海、卷起波涛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华是我的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我把我的话传给你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用我的手庇护你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我铺展诸天，奠立大地的根基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对锡安说，‘你是我的子民。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["耶路撒冷啊，醒来，醒来，站起来吧！",{"text":"你从耶和华手中的杯里喝了祂的愤怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝干了那杯使人东倒西歪的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你生育的儿子没有一个来引导你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你抚养成人的众子没有一个来搀扶你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这两样灾祸临到你身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁会为你哀哭呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒凉和毁灭、饥荒和战祸临到你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能安慰你呢","poem":1},{"noteId":22},{"text":"？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的孩子昏倒在街头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像羚羊掉进网罗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们饱尝耶和华的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"承受你上帝的责备。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这身受痛苦、并非因酒而醉的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听好了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的主耶和华是为祂子民申辩的上帝，祂说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，我已从你手中拿走那使人东倒西歪的杯，就是盛满我愤怒的碗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不再喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必把这杯给苦待你的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们对你说，‘趴下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们好从你身上走过。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你把你的背当作地面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当作街道任人走过。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":22,"caller":"+","text":"“谁能安慰你呢”有古卷作“我该怎样安慰你呢”。","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":19}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/51.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/52.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/50.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}